PLACEHOLDER -- original content is missing upstream.

This file arrived from AI_GP/isaac_drone_racer as a Git LFS pointer whose
object does not exist on that remote (git lfs pull returns 404). The content is
gone, not merely un-fetched.

Nothing in the training path loads this file; the USD assets are real and carry
baked geometry. It is needed only to regenerate the drone asset from
5_in_drone.urdf. If you need it, ask whoever committed it originally -- it is
most likely still on their disk.

Kept as plain text rather than as the original pointer so it cannot be mistaken
for a fetchable LFS object, and so pushes do not fail trying to upload it.

See assets/BROKEN_LFS_OBJECTS.md.
